    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nChurchfields is an exclusive development of spacious three and four-bedroom family homes by renowned developers Axis Living, located in Gorey, Co. Wexford.\n\nSituated in a superb location, just 1km away from Main Street, Gorey, the development has an unrivalled list of amenities close by including great schools, wonderful sporting amenities and great shopping on your doorstep. Convenience is the key at Churchfields and the vibrant town of Gorey is right beside you. The Book Cafe & Bistro, Joannnes Cafe, Katie Daly's Bar & Restaurant and The Raspberry Restaurant are only minutes away and there are several boutique shops including Liz Collins Boutique, Fifth Avenue & The Dressing Room to browse around. Gorey is buzzing. It is a great town, full of activity and a has a great community and lots to do. That is why it is a rapidly expanding, thriving location. \n\nChurchfields enjoys great connectivity, and the M/N11 at Junction 23 is very close, so access to, Dublin, Wexford Town and Rosslare Europort and the entire East Coast are at hand. Gorey's position close to the coast and North Wexford's unrivalled beaches mean you have the perfect place to put down roots. The M50 in south Dublin is an hour by car, so the Capital is at hand.\n\nChurchfields will feature levels of energy efficiency that far exceed traditional housing developments. A wide variety of features such as high levels of insulation in the walls, floors and roof along with a state of the art air to water central heating system, highly efficient, thermostatically controlled radiators, high performance windows and solar panels combine to ensure lower energy usage and higher levels of luxury. All of the homes will enjoy a BER A1 rating. A very large, landscaped area forms a central part of the development. \n\nFor more information, please contact Sherry FitzGerald New Homes, on 01 667 1888 or Sherry FitzGerald O'Leary Kinsella on 053 9430088\n\n*Photos of similar style home."
      },
      {
